{"term": {"label": "德", "occurrences": 3, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "年", "id": "年"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "益", "id": "益"}, {"form": "相", "id": "相"}, {"form": "瞽瞍", "id": "瞽瞍"}, {"form": "禹", "id": "禹"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "舜", "id": "舜"}, {"form": "莫", "id": "莫"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.6853650401178903, "source": "瞽瞍", "target": "舜"}, {"weight": 2.367123614131617, "source": "瞽瞍", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 1.519825753744413, "source": "養", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 0.7576857016975165, "source": "養", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.906120114864304, "source": "養", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "養", "target": "莫"}, {"weight": 2.367123614131617, "source": "養", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.048669883013082, "source": "年", "target": "禹"}, {"weight": 1.807507826196194, "source": "年", "target": "益"}, {"weight": 1.9616585060234524, "source": "年", "target": "相"}, {"weight": 1.6739764335716716, "source": "年", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.24353228783885106, "source": "舜", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.0908301482260547, "source": "舜", "target": "相"}, {"weight": 0.9955199684217299, "source": "舜", "target": "禹"}, {"weight": 0.6853650401178903, "source": "舜", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.4541349911212467, "source": "相", "target": "禹"}, {"weight": 2.5006550067561393, "source": "相", "target": "益"}, {"weight": 1.1143606456362487, "source": "相", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 0.35222059358935215, "source": "相", "target"